MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phase 12 implements three high-impact optimizations:

- Fused encode+AND+popcount kernel (forward_fused) eliminates intermediate
  input bitstream materialization, generating Bernoulli bits on-the-fly and
  immediately accumulating popcount against weight words
- xoshiro256++ replaces ChaCha8 for all fast-path encoding (forward, forward_fast,
  forward_fused, batch_encode_numpy); ChaCha8 retained for weight packing
- Batched dense forward API (forward_batch_numpy) processes N input samples in
  one FFI call via par_chunks_mut, amortizing Python→Rust overhead

Benchmarks: dense batch 42.0x vs v2, LIF multi 512.4x vs v2.
173 Python tests + 8 co-sim + 20 Rust unit tests pass. Sacred files untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
